Investigate the existing T3Code and Paseo bridges and how bots can use them to spawn coding agents in new T3Code/Paseo threads. Identify the supported flow, integration gaps, and any fixes needed to make this capability reliable.

Decision (2026-11-02 batch): independent investigation lane, no shared runtime registries without coordination. No T3Code/Paseo integration found in src; sibling paseo-bridge and apmv worktrees contain bridge implementations. Inspect authoritative local bridge sources and document exact supported spawning flows, identities, gaps, and bounded Clawq fixes where justified. Do not create real remote agent tasks during research.